{"n":80,"ar":"عبس","tr":"'Abasa","en":"He Frowned","type":"meccan","verses":[[1,"عَبَسَ وَتَوَلَّىٰٓ","AAabasa watawalla","He frowned and turned away"],[2,"أَن جَآءَهُ ٱلۡأَعۡمَىٰ","An jaahu alaAAma","Because the blind man came unto him"],[3,"وَمَا يُدۡرِيكَ لَعَلَّهُۥ يَزَّكَّىٰٓ","Wama yudreeka laAAallahu yazzakka","What could inform thee but that he might grow (in grace)"],[4,"أَوۡ يَذَّكَّرُ فَتَنفَعَهُ ٱلذِّكۡرَىٰٓ","Aw yaththakkaru fatanfaAAahu alththikra","Or take heed and so the reminder might avail him"],[5,"أَمَّا مَنِ ٱسۡتَغۡنَىٰ","Amma mani istaghna","As for him who thinketh himself independent"],[6,"فَأَنتَ لَهُۥ تَصَدَّىٰ","Faanta lahu tasadda","Unto him thou payest regard"],[7,"وَمَا عَلَيۡكَ أَلَّا يَزَّكَّىٰ","Wama AAalayka alla yazzakka","Yet it is not thy concern if he grow not (in grace)"],[8,"وَأَمَّا مَن جَآءَكَ يَسۡعَىٰ","Waamma man jaaka yasAAa","But as for him who cometh unto thee with earnest purpose"],[9,"وَهُوَ يَخۡشَىٰ","Wahuwa yakhsha","And hath fear"],[10,"فَأَنتَ عَنۡهُ تَلَهَّىٰ","Faanta AAanhu talahha","From him thou art distracted"],[11,"كَلَّآ إِنَّهَا تَذۡكِرَةٞ","Kalla innaha tathkiratun","Nay, but verily it is an Admonishment"],[12,"فَمَن شَآءَ ذَكَرَهُۥ","Faman shaa thakarahu","So let whosoever will pay heed to it"],[13,"فِي صُحُفٖ مُّكَرَّمَةٖ","Fee suhufin mukarramatin","On honoured leaves"],[14,"مَّرۡفُوعَةٖ مُّطَهَّرَةِۭ","MarfooAAatin mutahharatin","Exalted, purified"],[15,"بِأَيۡدِي سَفَرَةٖ","Biaydee safaratin","(Set down) by scribes"],[16,"كِرَامِۭ بَرَرَةٖ","Kiramin bararatin","Noble and righteous"],[17,"قُتِلَ ٱلۡإِنسَٰنُ مَآ أَكۡفَرَهُۥ","Qutila alinsanu ma akfarahu","Man is (self-)destroyed: how ungrateful"],[18,"مِنۡ أَيِّ شَيۡءٍ خَلَقَهُۥ","Min ayyi shayin khalaqahu","From what thing doth He create him"],[19,"مِن نُّطۡفَةٍ خَلَقَهُۥ فَقَدَّرَهُۥ","Min nutfatin khalaqahu faqaddarahu","From a drop of seed. He createth him and proportioneth him"],[20,"ثُمَّ ٱلسَّبِيلَ يَسَّرَهُۥ","Thumma alssabeela yassarahu","Then maketh the way easy for him"],[21,"ثُمَّ أَمَاتَهُۥ فَأَقۡبَرَهُۥ","Thumma amatahu faaqbarahu","Then causeth him to die, and burieth him"],[22,"ثُمَّ إِذَا شَآءَ أَنشَرَهُۥ","Thumma itha shaa ansharahu","Then, when He will, He bringeth him again to life"],[23,"كَلَّا لَمَّا يَقۡضِ مَآ أَمَرَهُۥ","Kalla lamma yaqdi ma amarahu","Nay, but (man) hath not done what He commanded him"],[24,"فَلۡيَنظُرِ ٱلۡإِنسَٰنُ إِلَىٰ طَعَامِهِۦٓ","Falyanthuri alinsanu ila taAAamihi","Let man consider his food"],[25,"أَنَّا صَبَبۡنَا ٱلۡمَآءَ صَبّٗا","Anna sababna almaa sabban","How We pour water in showers"],[26,"ثُمَّ شَقَقۡنَا ٱلۡأَرۡضَ شَقّٗا","Thumma shaqaqna alarda shaqqan","Then split the earth in clefts"],[27,"فَأَنۢبَتۡنَا فِيهَا حَبّٗا","Faanbatna feeha habban","And cause the grain to grow therein"],[28,"وَعِنَبٗا وَقَضۡبٗا","WaAAinaban waqadban","And grapes and green fodder"],[29,"وَزَيۡتُونٗا وَنَخۡلٗا","Wazaytoonan wanakhlan","And olive-trees and palm-trees"],[30,"وَحَدَآئِقَ غُلۡبٗا","Wahadaiqa ghulban","And garden-closes of thick foliage"],[31,"وَفَٰكِهَةٗ وَأَبّٗا","Wafakihatan waabban","And fruits and grasses"],[32,"مَّتَٰعٗا لَّكُمۡ وَلِأَنۡعَٰمِكُمۡ","MataAAan lakum walianAAamikum","Provision for you and your cattle"],[33,"فَإِذَا جَآءَتِ ٱلصَّآخَّةُ","Faitha jaati alssakhkhatu","But when the Shout cometh"],[34,"يَوۡمَ يَفِرُّ ٱلۡمَرۡءُ مِنۡ أَخِيهِ","Yawma yafirru almaro min akheehi","On the day when a man fleeth from his brother"],[35,"وَأُمِّهِۦ وَأَبِيهِ","Waommihi waabeehi","And his mother and his father"],[36,"وَصَٰحِبَتِهِۦ وَبَنِيهِ","Wasahibatihi wabaneehi","And his wife and his children"],[37,"لِكُلِّ ٱمۡرِيٕٖ مِّنۡهُمۡ يَوۡمَئِذٖ شَأۡنٞ يُغۡنِيهِ","Likulli imriin minhum yawmaithin shanun yughneehi","Every man that day will have concern enough to make him heedless (of others)"],[38,"وُجُوهٞ يَوۡمَئِذٖ مُّسۡفِرَةٞ","Wujoohun yawmaithin musfiratun","On that day faces will be bright as dawn"],[39,"ضَاحِكَةٞ مُّسۡتَبۡشِرَةٞ","Dahikatun mustabshiratun","Laughing, rejoicing at good news"],[40,"وَوُجُوهٞ يَوۡمَئِذٍ عَلَيۡهَا غَبَرَةٞ","Wawujoohun yawmaithin AAalayha ghabaratun","And other faces, on that day, with dust upon them"],[41,"تَرۡهَقُهَا قَتَرَةٌ","Tarhaquha qataratun","Veiled in darkness"],[42,"أُوْلَـٰٓئِكَ هُمُ ٱلۡكَفَرَةُ ٱلۡفَجَرَةُ","Olaika humu alkafaratu alfajaratu","Those are the disbelievers, the wicked"]]}